## Legacy

![A family of four, including two women, a man, and a girl, sitting at a kitchen counter, smiling and laughing together in a bright, modern living room.](/images/pages/legacy/78ae1dfa20-9cdf7e99-6f8e-4ed2-9f69-941c60626897.webp)

#### Stewardship that outlives you.

Legacy is a season of its own. We help you name the principles behind your plan, align structures and roles, and prepare the next stewards. Through the [**Family Meeting**](/family-meeting), we turn assumptions into shared understanding and document who does what, when, and why—so assets become a living inheritance: wisdom, not just wealth.

#### What we focus on

-   Family Meeting facilitation and follow-ups
    
-   Values statement + stewardship plan
    
-   Role clarity for executors/trustees/beneficiaries
    
-   Estate alignment (with legal/tax advisors)
    
-   Charitable strategy and “giving while alive”
    

#### Who it’s for

-   Families with heirs or blended family dynamics
    
-   Business owners planning succession
    
-   Philanthropically inclined households
    
-   New beneficiaries seeking confidence and capability
    

